stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Staged: phone finishes sending verified bytes
    Staged --> Filed: partner saves to selected deal
    Staged --> Staged: storage check fails or database rolls back
    Filed --> Filed: retry save or read receipt
    Staged --> Cancelled: partner discards before save
    Staged --> Expired: staging deadline passes
    Expired --> Cleaned: cleanup confirms orphan deletion
    Expired --> Expired: deletion fails, retain charge and failure receipt
    Cancelled --> Cancelled: save refuses
    Cleaned --> Cleaned: save refuses
    %% never File a document under a different deal
    %% never Delete a filed document during expiry or cancellation
    %% never Return two attachment IDs for one upload
